    <string name="perf_warning_title">These profiles may make your phone unstable</string>
    <string name="perf_warning_body">They run the processor and graphics faster than Samsung allows. The phone can get hot, apps can close, and it can restart by itself. If it restarts by itself within 3 minutes of starting, Performance switches back to Max.</string>

    <string name="perf_drawer_title">Show in app drawer</string>
    <string name="perf_drawer_summary">Open Performance straight from your app list</string>
    <string name="perf_footer">Heat protection always stays on. If the phone gets too warm it slows itself down, whatever profile you choose. A new profile starts after a restart.</string>
